      "excerpt": "An indoor holiday market with local vendors in the former Barnes &amp; Noble space at City Center.",
      "text": "An indoor holiday market with local vendors in the former Barnes &amp; Noble space at City Center.\n\nSeasonal\n\nDowntown White Plains Holiday Market\n\nAn indoor holiday market with local vendors in the former Barnes & Noble space at City Center.\n\nAbout this event\n\nThe Downtown White Plains Holiday Market ran from December 5 through December 14, 2025, from 11:00 a.m. to 7:00 p.m. each day.\n\nIt brought local vendors into the former Barnes & Noble space at City Center for a stretch of holiday shopping downtown.\n\nMore links\n\nOpen flyer (PDF)\n\nAt a Glance\n\nStatus\n\nPast\n\nDate\n\nFriday, December 5, 2025 to December 14, 2025\n\nTime\n\n11:00 AM - 7:00 PM\n\nLocation\n\nWhite Plains City Center, former Barnes & Noble space\n\nAddress\n\nWhite Plains City Center, White Plains, NY 10601\n\nSource\n\nWhite Plains BID\n\nMore Events\n\nRelated events\n\nBlock-toberfest\n\nOct 26, 2025\n\nA free fall block party with music, games, vendors, and family activities downtown.\n\nDowntown White Plains Wing Walk 2025\n\nApr 26, 2025\n\nA downtown wing tasting with voting, timed entry, and stops at restaurants around White Plains.\n\nDowntown White Plains Wing Walk 2026\n\nApr 25, 2026\n\nA ticketed wing tasting across downtown White Plains, with voting and stops at local restaurants."
