      "text": "Through playful literacy movement games, music, stretching, and creative activities, children will jump, wiggle, dance, and explore different ways their…\n\nLearning\n\nGet Moving!\n\nThrough playful literacy movement games, music, stretching, and creative activities, children will jump, wiggle, dance, and explore different ways their…\n\nAbout this event\n\nThrough playful literacy movement games, music, stretching, and creative activities, children will jump, wiggle, dance, and explore different ways their bodies can move. The class supports early childhood development by combining physical activity with creativity and social interaction in a welcoming library environment. Check the library page for registration, tickets, and any schedule updates.\n\nAt a Glance\n\nStatus\n\nPast\n\nDate\n\nMonday, May 11, 2026\n\nTime\n\n11:00 AM - 11:30 AM\n\nLocation\n\nWhite Plains Public Library\n\nAddress\n\n100 Martine Avenue, White Plains, NY 10601\n\nSource\n\nWhite Plains Public Library\n\nMore Events\n\nRelated events\n\nOver the Rainbow and Through the Woods\n\nMay 17, 2026\n\nPack your (imaginary) bags and join musical educator Rebecca Schoffer for a joyful, interactive sing-along celebrating Jewish Am erican Heritage Month!\n\nOver in the Meadow: VR Search and Find!\n\nMay 19, 2026\n\nExperience Virtual Reality (VR) without a headset in the Library's panoramic content room.\n\nWellness Connection\n\nJun 22, 2026\n\nJoin Jeffrey from Inclure, a program developed by the Harris Project & WJCS that brings teens together for fun, supportive, and wellness-centered…"
