      "text": "Explore White Plains through an interactive neighborhood map and a map-aligned neighborhood guide.\n\nNeighborhoods\n\nNeighborhood Associations\n\nExplore the neighborhood associations currently represented in WPCNA. Use the map for citywide context, then open an association profile to learn more.\n\nHover or tap a highlighted area to connect the map and association cards.\n\nAssociation Profiles\n\nDirectory\n\nAll Neighborhoods\n\nAll 41 White Plains neighborhoods, listed A to Z.\n\nBattle Hill\n\nBrook Hills\n\nBryant Gardens\n\nCarhart\n\nChurch Street\n\nColonial Corners\n\nDowntown\n\nEastview\n\nFerris Avenue\n\nFisher Hill\n\nFulton Street\n\nGateway\n\nGedney Circle\n\nGedney Commons\n\nGedney Farms\n\nGedney Manor\n\nGedney Meadows\n\nGedney Park\n\nGood Counsel\n\nGovernment Center\n\nHavilands Manor\n\nHealth Center\n\nHighlands\n\nHillair Circle\n\nHolbrooke\n\nIdle Forest\n\nKirkbride Asylum\n\nNorth Broadway\n\nNorth Street\n\nOld Mamaroneck Road\n\nOld Oak Ridge\n\nProspect Park\n\nReynal Park\n\nRocky Dell\n\nRosedale\n\nSaxon Woods\n\nSoundview\n\nWestchester Avenue\n\nWestminster Ridge\n\nWinbrook\n\nWoodcrest Heights"
